# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if cloud platform requires it, you might need to share it.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock can be submitted to version control if desired.
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock is co-managed by version control in most cases
.pdm-plugins/
.pdm-build/

